################################################################################
#
# SKWIFI Firmware Files
#
# This directory should contain firmware files required for the SKW (Seekwave)
# WiFi/BT module (SV6160/SV6158).
#
# IMPORTANT: The Seekwave firmware files are PROPRIETARY and NOT included in the
# SDK. You must obtain them from Seekwave Electronics directly.
#
# How to Obtain Firmware:
# -----------------------
# Option 1: Contact Seekwave
#   Contact Seekwave Electronics to obtain the official firmware package.
#   Email: contact@seekwave.com (or check official website)
#
# Option 2: From LB200 Board Recovery Image
#   If you have a working LB200 board, the firmware files may be located at:
#   /lib/firmware/seekwave/ or /vendor/firmware/seekwave/
#   on the existing system.
#
# Required Files for SDIO Interface:
# -----------------------------------
# The following firmware files are needed for SDIO mode (LB200 board):
#   - SWT6652_IRAM_SDIO.bin  (WiFi IRAM firmware)
#   - SWT6652_DRAM_SDIO.bin  (WiFi DRAM firmware)
#   - SWT6652_NVM_SDIO.bin   (WiFi NVM calibration data)
#   - bt_firmware.bin        (Bluetooth firmware)
#
# Installation:
# -------------
# Copy the firmware files to this directory:
#   /home/morty/work/share/mc_os/operating-system/buildroot-external/package/skwifi/fw/
#
# The SKWIFI package Makefile will install these files to:
#   /lib/firmware/seekwave/
#
# SDK Driver Modules:
# -------------------
# The precompiled SKW driver modules from SDK are available in ../driver/:
#   - skw6316.ko     (SKWIFI core module)
#   - skwbt.ko      (Bluetooth module)
#   - skw_sdio_v20.ko (SDIO interface driver)
#
################################################################################

# Note: The SDK does not include SKWIFI firmware files. The firmware is
# proprietary and must be obtained from Seekwave Electronics or from a
# working LB200 board's recovery/system image.
#
# Unlike Realtek or Broadcom WiFi firmware, the Seekwave firmware is not
# available in open source repositories.
#
################################################################################
